# ── build artifacts (the DLL is rebuilt from dllmain.cpp by build.bat) ──
d3dcap.dll
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
__pycache__/

# ── ROM-DERIVED CAPTURE OUTPUT — NEVER COMMIT (BYOR ground rule) ──
# A .pack embeds the game's own texture pixels, vertex buffer and shader bytecode.
# Live captures land in %TEMP%\rrcap and never here, but guard anyway.
*.pack
*.cso
*.bin
*.bmp
*.ndjson
